  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/lrtactical.png\" alt=\"\"> 为《古法与时新枪械：零》添加投掷物、近战武器及更多枪包支持的扩展模组。</p><h2>内容与特性</h2><p>内置包包含：</p><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.39.12.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.37.26.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.37.50.png\" alt=\"\"></p><ul>\n<li>蝴蝶刀包含在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-x-lr-cs2-knifes-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CS2 Knifes Packet</a>中</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/2025-05-26_16.38.54.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h3>近战武器</h3><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/melee.png\" alt=\"\"></p><ul>\n<li>匕首</li>\n<li>爪刀（Karambit）</li>\n<li>棒球棍</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>投掷物</h3><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/throwable.png\" alt=\"\"></p><ul>\n<li>M67手雷</li>\n<li>RGN手雷</li>\n<li>烟雾弹</li>\n<li>闪光弹</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>护盾</h3><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/shield.png\" alt=\"\"></p><ul>\n<li>闪光护盾</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>依赖</h2><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/dependency.png\" alt=\"\"> **该扩展所需的TACZ版本如下表所示。</p><h2><strong>这是一个模组，请将.jar文件放入mods文件夹中，而非tacz枪包路径。您需要TACZ 1.1.5及以上版本作为依赖。</strong></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>我的世界版本</th>\n<th>扩展版本</th>\n<th>TaCZ版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>0.2.3</td>\n<td>1.1.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><h2>UGC支持</h2><p><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/26/ugc.png\" alt=\"\"> 额外能力：为TACZ枪包定义近战武器和投掷物。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deltaforce-melee-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/11/14/seve.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-x-lr-cs2-knifes-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://q1.boheurl.com/lesraisins/i/2025/05/30/cs2pack.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-lr-trench-tactics-ww1-gadget-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trench Tactics 一战装备包</a></p>",
